   NEVER expose CustomerId as a tool parameter.

   The following must remain authoritative:

   MCP tool
       ↓
   IBankingService
       ↓
   ICurrentUserAccessor
       ↓
   NB_SID server-side session
       ↓
   authenticated CustomerId
       ↓
   ownership-filtered database query

   The LLM must never be able to choose the CustomerId.

   Do not trust CustomerId supplied through:
   - tool arguments
   - chat messages
   - MCP arguments
   - request body
   - query string

